# Context Index

Summary: Router for this workspace's private context. `AGENTS.md` states the boundaries; this file routes to topics, projects and issues. It records no requirements of its own.

## Global topics

| Need | Read |
|---|---|
| Mandatory boundaries and rule strength | [policy.md](policy.md) |
| Cross-project principles and defaults | [principles.md](principles.md) |
| Role loading contracts (DESIGN/CODING/TESTING) | [roles.md](roles.md) |
| Tool and command conventions | [tooling.md](tooling.md) |
| Shared vocabulary | [glossary.md](glossary.md) |
{{- if .Go}}
| Go workspace conventions | [go-standards.md](go-standards.md) |
{{- end}}
{{- if .Python}}
| Python/uv workspace conventions | [python-standards.md](python-standards.md) |
{{- end}}

## Projects

Project context lives at `.agents/context/<project-id>/INDEX.md`. Registered projects are derived from `.gitmodules` and routed from the managed region of `AGENTS.md`; this index does not duplicate that list. Never load sibling project context.

## Issues

Workspace and cross-project issues live under `issues/` when present, one Markdown file per issue following `templates/issue.md`. Read only the issue a task names or that its router points to; never load the collection wholesale.

## Infrastructure

- Project context templates: `templates/project/`
- Issue template: `templates/issue.md`

## Stop reading when

The active task's authority, constraints, validation mode and target area are known. Load only what the task names; never preload this tree.
